#!markdown

# 02 · Sequences and file I/O

**EN** — Read FASTA and FASTQ, inspect composition, find ORFs and restriction sites, align two sequences, and draw a sequence logo and a dot plot.

**ID** — Membaca FASTA dan FASTQ, memeriksa komposisi, mencari ORF dan situs restriksi, menyejajarkan dua sekuens, serta menggambar logo sekuens dan dot plot.

*Dibuat oleh Gravicode Studios dipimpin oleh Kang Fadhil*

#!csharp

#r "nuget: Gravicode.Biotech.Net.Notebooks, 0.1.0"
// Local build instead of NuGet (run `dotnet build Biotech.Net.slnx` first), comment the line above and use:
// #r "../src/Biotech.Net.Notebooks/bin/Debug/net10.0/Biotech.Net.Notebooks.dll"

#!csharp

using Biotech.Net.Core;
using Biotech.Net.Sequences;
using Biotech.Net.Sequences.IO;
using Biotech.Net.Alignments;
using Biotech.Net.Native;   // AlignmentMode
using Biotech.Net.Visualization;
using Biotech.Net.Notebooks;

BiotechFormatters.Register();

#!markdown

## FASTA · FASTA

#!csharp

var fasta = """
>pUC_fragment lacZ alpha region
ATGACCATGATTACGCCAAGCTTGCATGCCTGCAGGTCGACTCTAGAGGATCCCCGGGTACCGAGCTCGAATTCACTGGCCGTCGTTTTACAACGTCGTGACTGGGAAAACCCTGGCG
>variant_copy
ATGACCATGATTACGCCAAGCTTGCATGCCTGCAGGTCGACTCTAGAGGATCCCCGGGTACCGAGCTCGAATTCACTGGCCGTCGTTTTACAACGTCGTGACTGGGAAAACCCTGGCG
""";
var records = FastaReader.Parse(fasta);
records[0]

#!csharp

var orfs = OrfFinder.Find(records[0], new OrfOptions { MinLength = 30 });
orfs

#!csharp

// Restriction digest with common cloning enzymes · Pemotongan dengan enzim restriksi
RestrictionDigest.Digest(records[0], false, "EcoRI", "BamHI", "HindIII")

#!markdown

## FASTQ reads · Read FASTQ

#!csharp

var fastq = """
@read1
ACGTACGTTAGCTAGCTAGGATCGATCGATTACG
+
IIIIIIIIIIIIIHHHHHGGGGFFFF####!!!!
@read2
TTGCAGGATCCATGACCATGATTACGCCAAGCTT
+
IIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIIII
""";
var reads = FastqReader.Parse(fastq);
reads[0]

#!markdown

## Pairwise alignment · Penyejajaran berpasangan

#!csharp

var aligner = new PairwiseAligner { Mode = AlignmentMode.Global, MatchScore = 2, MismatchScore = -1, OpenGapScore = -4, ExtendGapScore = -1 };
aligner.Align(Sequence.Dna("GATTACAGATTACAGGCT", "target"), Sequence.Dna("GATTCAGATTTACAGCT", "query"))

#!markdown

## Sequence logo and dot plot · Logo sekuens dan dot plot

A logo of bacterial −10 promoter boxes (Pribnow box), in bits.
Logo kotak promoter −10 bakteri (kotak Pribnow), dalam satuan bit.

#!csharp

new SequenceLogo(new[] { "TATAAT", "TATAAT", "TATGAT", "TACAAT", "TATAAT", "GATAAT", "TATACT", "TATAAT", "TAAAAT", "TATATT" })
{
    Title = "−10 box (Pribnow)"
}

#!csharp

var seq = records[0];
var inverted = seq.Subsequence(0, 60).Concat(seq.Subsequence(60, seq.Length - 60).ReverseComplement(), "inverted");
new DotPlot(seq, inverted, window: 8)
